  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Face to face with Christ my <chord name="Cm7"/>Sav<chord name="F7"/>iour, Face to face, what will it <chord name="Bb"/>be,<br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>When with rapture I <chord name="Eb"/>behold Him, <chord name="Edim7"/>Jesus <chord name="Bb"/>Christ, who <chord name="Dm"/>died <chord name="F7"/>for <chord name="Bb"/>me?<br/>
      <chord name="F7"/>Face to face shall <chord name="Bb"/>I behold Him, <chord name="F"/>Far be<chord name="C7"/>yond the starry <chord name="F"/>sk<chord name="Bb"/>y;<chord name="F7"/><br/>
      <chord name="Bb"/>Face to face in all His <chord name="Eb"/>glory <chord name="Edim7"/>I shall <chord name="Bb"/>see Him <chord name="Dm"/>by <chord name="F7"/>and <chord name="Bb"/>by!
      </lines>
    </verse>
